{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01O1FHEblcBNzdtt1eY30h02","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"FRAME 4:2 Start Here · Brief\n FRAME 4:3 Header\n  TEXT 4:4 LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2 :: LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\n  TEXT 4:5 Vulcan Invest — banking and stock investing :: Vulcan Invest — banking and stock investing\n  TEXT 4:6 Design the investing area of Vulcan Bank’s app: from the home screen, open Invest for the first time, set a PIN, review the portfolio, study a stock and buy one share with a confirmation. Canvas 414 × 896, iPhone. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference. :: Design the investing area of Vulcan Bank’s app: from the home screen, open Invest for the first time, set a PIN, review the portfolio, study a stock and buy one share with a confirmation. Canvas 414 × 896, iPhone. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\n FRAME 4:7 How to work\n  TEXT 4:8 How to work :: How to work\n  TEXT 4:9 1. Build exactly the 7 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the illustration, company logos and icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of th