{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_bdrk_uhqubtzmgb3tf24pvv6yv2wht4rvl55c66ebxl5cie67ltjcbj7s","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All seven screens are built in 03 · Workspace and wired as a clickable prototype. I checked each one in a screenshot, and every link required by the brief checked out. I used account zuohaosheng@tetras.ai, and the reference pages (00, 01, 02, 04) were not changed.\n\n**File:** https://www.figma.com/design/ZdObl2tW59mHrZDXTJrxzA/\n**03 · Workspace page ID:** `5:2`\n\n| Screen | Node ID |\n|---|---|\n| 01_Home | `15:153` |\n| 02_About_Investment | `15:286` |\n| 03_Create_PIN | `16:283` |\n| 04_Portfolio | `16:386` |\n| 05_Trading | `17:515` |\n| 06_Stock_Transaction | `17:708` |\n| 07_Confirm_Purchase | `18:769` |\n| Components · Vulcan Invest (component library) | `7:2` |\n\n**Prototype:** The flow starts at 01_Home. All 13 required links work:\n- **01:** Invest tab → 02\n- **02:** start → 03; back → 01\n- **03:** Ready → 04; back → 02\n- **04:** AAPL card → 05; back → 01; Main tab → 01\n- **05:** Buy → 06; back → 04\n- **06:** Buy → 07; back → 05\n- **07:** Cancel → 06\n\nForward steps slide in from the right, back steps slide back, and tab switches and the dialog fade in. As the brief says, Buy on 07 and the other entry-only controls have no link.\n\n**Design system:**\n- **Style:** Light screens throughout, using the fixed brand red #FA5555 and Inter. Gains are green #12A46B, losses red #E5484D, and Sell uses dark ink. A token row in the component section lists the colours, type scale, spacing, corner radii and shadows.\n- **Components I built:** tab item and tab bar (Main or Invest selected), icon button with an optional unread dot, header with on/off switches for its actions, balance card, page dots, quick action, history row (outgoing/incoming), PIN slot (filled/next/empty), keypad key (default/pressed) and keypad, earnings bar chart, AAPL candlestick chart, stock card (gain/loss), summary card, period selector (default/selected), Buy/Sell buttons, stock info, account option (selected/not selected), extra button states (secondary/pressed/disabled) and the confirm dialog.\n- **Reused from the file:** the Button, Text Field, Status Bar and Home Indicator from 02, and the illustration, four company logos and icons from 04 are used directly as instances.\n\n**Things you might not expect:**\n- **Added copy:** Four short lines aren't in the brief's text: the \"Vulcan Bank\" header on 01, the PIN instruction and \"3 of 4\" counter on 03, the chart and section labels on 04/05 (\"Monthly earnings\", \"AAPL · Intraday\", \"4 stocks\"), and the dialog's supporting line \"Buy 1 share of Apple Inc. (AAPL) at $143.43\". All required copy and data match the brief exactly.\n- **07 has no tab bar.** The brief says 07 has none, so I removed it from the copy of 06 that sits behind the dialog.\n- **04_Portfolio doesn't scroll.** I fitted everything into the 896 px screen by showing the four stocks as a 2×2 grid, so no scrolling is set up.\n\n**Limitations:** The charts are drawn as static shapes; the bar heights and candle values between the axis limits are illustrative, which the brief allows. Nothing required by the brief is unfinished."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":26,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3271,"cache_read_input_tokens":99659,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3271,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":820,"service_tier":"standard","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"78d3d31b-6672-47a6-a033-f1b5556e3e7d","uuid":"c35ad439-40b1-40cd-b782-db8019648e60","timestamp":"2026-11-02T07:20:32.552Z"}
